 choose to accept the insurance-covered chair and pay the difference out of pocket to upgrade to their preferred model. Some manufacturers also have assistance programs. We can also explore whether your wheelchair basketball organization has equipment grants.\'\n\n**6. Commit to partnership**:\n\'I want you to know that I am on your side in this fight. I will write the strongest letter I can, and I will advocate for you throughout the appeal process. This may take some time, but we will work through it together.\'\n\n**Key principles**: Validate frustration while being honest about limitations, prescribe by functional specification rather than brand, strategic approach to insurance justification, offer multiple pathways including appeal and out-of-pocket options, maintain advocacy partnership.',
